# Pirate's Cutlass {3}: "When this Equipment enters, attach it to target Pirate you control. Equipped creature gets +2/+1.
# Equip {2}". Bot1 controls two Fanatical Firebrands (1/1 Goblin Pirates) and a Memnite; Bot2 controls a Fanatical Firebrand
# too. When the Cutlass enters, the Memnite (not a Pirate) and Bot2's Firebrand (not Bot1's) are refused and Bot1's second
# Firebrand is chosen: it becomes 3/2 and the first stays 1/1. With every source tapped for the Cutlass, equip is refused (short
# of {2}). On turn 5 two Moxen pay the equip onto the Memnite: it becomes 3/2 and the Firebrand is 1/1 again.

